          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-[#ede7dc]">
            <button type="button" class="btn-play-single px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#f0eae1] hover:bg-[#e4dcce] text-[#132A22] text-xs font-bold transition-colors cursor-pointer" data-target="card-vka">
              ▶ Тест в цикле
